│                          │ unconditional third zero-phase SG pass after the slope-lead compensation suppresses       │
│                          │ residual output ripple introduced by the lead step. Using a small half-window `h = max(2, │
│                          │ sg_half//3)` with order-2 coefficients keeps lag cost negligible (zero-phase, tiny        │
│                          │ kernel), while flattening micro-oscillations that drive false reversals and smoothness    │
