│                          │ (window_size//4) so the pipeline's smoothness advantage is not lost. The combined         │
│                          │ pipeline: volatility schedule → Kalman → RTS → volatility-gated multi-scale SG blend →    │
│                          │ slope-lead compensation → light zero-phase SG polish → end-aligned trim. This targets     │
│                          │ simultaneously responsiveness (small scales in quiet regions), noise suppression (large   │
│                          │ scales in volatile regions), and reversal suppression (lead compensation + polish), while │
│                          │ keeping the identical API (adaptive_filter, enhanced_filter_with_trend_preservation,      │
│                          │ process_signal) and output contract (length = n - window_size + 1).                       │
